// HUD assets the weapondefs reference that are NOT resident on every enabled map.
// hud_flamethrower_reticle (tesla + thundergun reticleCenter) is scope=top in frontend,
// zm_transit, zm_highrise, zm_buried and zm_tomb but NOT zm_prison or zm_nuked -- which is
// exactly where it rendered as a teal checkerboard. Zoning it copies it from a loaded ff into
// the shared mod.ff, so it resolves everywhere. hud_thundergun is not a stock asset at all;
// its .iwi ships raw, and materials/hud_thundergun.json is authored from hud_tesla.json.
// hud_icon_colt (freezegun) needs nothing -- already scope=top on every map.
// The .iwi was extracted out of frontend.ff with Unlinker --image-format IWI (BUILD RULE 6).
// The Linker cannot pull image DATA from a --load'ed ff, so force-compiling the material
// requires the raw image to exist locally -- the build fails on it otherwise.
image,hud_flamethrower_reticle
material,hud_flamethrower_reticle
image,hud_thundergun
material,hud_thundergun
